# Per-target scratch and PoC scripts from hunting sessions. These belong to one target and one
# afternoon, not to the pipeline: probe/m<N> one-off scripts, captured pages, beautified bundles,
# survey output. Anchored to the repo root so nothing under src/ can ever match by accident.
/probe-*.mjs
/m[0-9]*-*.mjs
/scratch_*/
/tools_m*/

# Tool state generated on first run by projectdiscovery's goflags, not ours. provider-config.yaml is
# where subfinder would keep its data-source API keys, so it stays out either way.
/subfinder/
/httpx/

# npm's lockfile, for consistency with bun.lock above: this project does not version a lockfile.
/package-lock.json
